{'symbol': 'DVA', 'date': '2023-05-10 06:02:00', 'title': 'DAVITA RECOGNIZES NEPHROLOGY NURSES WITH DAISY AWARD', 'text': "RECOGNIZES NURSES WHO FURTHER DAVITA'S MISSION TO BE THE PROVIDER AND EMPLOYER OF CHOICE. DENVER , MAY 10, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0DAVITA INC. TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT 56 OF ITS NEPHROLOGY NURSES WERE HONORED WITH THE DAISY AWARD® FOR EXTRAORDINARY NURSES DURING NATIONAL NURSES WEEK."}